{"unit_id":"MoreanP2003__dsh-speed-gauge#feature-1","repo":"MoreanP2003/dsh-speed-gauge","commit":"2dfbe4fa46e551a14d103e8c26449be40e2a9afe","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-speed-gauge 的功能「实时生成速度」：在模型生成时统计文本、思考内容和工具参数的字符增量，并按滑动时间窗口换算为 tok/s。官方 usage 到达后会用于校准字符/token 比例。","source":"generated","evidence":["sampler.js:143-165","sampler.js:167-195","sampler.js:222-233"]}
{"unit_id":"MoreanP2003__dsh-speed-gauge#feature-2","repo":"MoreanP2003/dsh-speed-gauge","commit":"2dfbe4fa46e551a14d103e8c26449be40e2a9afe","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-speed-gauge 的功能「会话速度面板」：通过标题栏按钮展开或收起仪表盘，面板展示当前速度表、近期趋势、平均值、峰值和总输出，并跟随当前会话更新。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:1193-1289","client.js:1450-1538","host.js:28-41"]}
